senses.gloss:
आ-नत (तः-ता-तं)
a. Bent, bowed;
humbled; pacified; submissive.

अन_य (यः) 1.
m. Fate; calamity;
misfortune; vice.

अना_र्जव (वं) 1.
n. Crookedness;
duplicity, want of rectitude.

अन्न-कोष्ठ (ष्ठः) 1.
m. A granary;
Viṣṇu; the sun. Also अन्नकोष्ठकं.

अनधिक (कः-का-कं)
a. Boundless;
ne plus ultra.
